sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Istio/Envoy Gateway<br/>(maas-default-gateway)<br/>openshift-ingress
    participant PreProc as payload-pre-processing<br/>(ipp-pre ExtProc)<br/>9004/TCP gRPC
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant WasmPlugin<br/>(Authorization)
    participant PostProc as payload-processing<br/>(ipp ExtProc)<br/>9004/TCP gRPC
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Monitoring

    Note over Gateway,PostProc: EnvoyFilter Priority 10 - Filter Chain Order

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note right of Client: Inference Request Flow
        Client->>Gateway: HTTP Request<br/>(inference endpoint)

        rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
            Note over Gateway,PreProc: Pre-Auth Processing (failure_mode_allow: true)
            Gateway->>PreProc: ext_proc gRPC stream<br/>Request Headers + Buffered Body<br/>TLS SIMPLE (DestinationRule)
            PreProc->>PreProc: Run Praxis filter pipeline<br/>(pre-auth filters)
            PreProc-->>Gateway: Header/Body mutations<br/>or immediate response
        end

        Gateway->>Kuadrant: Authorization check<br/>(WasmPlugin)
        Kuadrant-->>Gateway: Auth decision

        rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
            Note over Gateway,PostProc: Post-Auth Processing (failure_mode_allow: false)
            Gateway->>PostProc: ext_proc gRPC stream<br/>Request Headers + Response Headers<br/>Buffered Bodies<br/>TLS SIMPLE (DestinationRule)
            PostProc->>PostProc: Run Praxis filter pipeline<br/>(post-auth filters, e.g. model_to_header)
            PostProc-->>Gateway: Header/Body mutations<br/>or immediate rejection
        end

        Gateway-->>Client: HTTP Response<br/>(mutated or rejected)
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note right of PostProc: Kubernetes API Reads
        PostProc->>K8sAPI: GET/LIST/WATCH ConfigMaps<br/>ServiceAccount Token Auth
        K8sAPI-->>PostProc: ConfigMap data
        PostProc->>K8sAPI: GET Secrets<br/>ServiceAccount Token Auth
        K8sAPI-->>PostProc: Secret data
        PostProc->>K8sAPI: GET/LIST/WATCH ExternalProviders<br/>(inference.opendatahub.io)
        K8sAPI-->>PostProc: ExternalProvider CRs
        PostProc->>K8sAPI: GET/LIST/WATCH ExternalModels<br/>(inference.opendatahub.io)
        K8sAPI-->>PostProc: ExternalModel CRs
    end

    rect rgb(252, 243, 255)
        Note right of Prometheus: Metrics Scraping
        Prometheus->>PostProc: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/1.1 Port 9090/TCP<br/>No Auth
        PostProc-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics<br/>(request counts, durations,<br/>immediate response counts)
    end
